# Agent instruction files — the self CLI rewrites their managed block from this
# project's own conventions, which are internal operating rules and do not belong
# in a public repository. What an agent must follow lives in CONTRIBUTING.md,
# which stays tracked and is what the README points an agent at.
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md

